Package: fastrel
Type: Package
Title: Fast Relatedness, Relationship and Kinship Matrices from Pedigrees
Version: 0.6.2
Authors@R: c(
  person("Alexandre", "Courtiol", email = "alexandre.courtiol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0637-2959"))
  )
Description: Computes quickly the main measures of identity by descent
    between the individuals of a pedigree: relatedness (additive relationship),
    kinship, and the coefficients of relationship of Wright and of relatedness
    of Hamilton. They can also be updated incrementally as individuals are
    born, die or migrate, as needed in individual-based simulations.
